\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad5d2a7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ad5d2a7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>On Monday, 21<sup>st<\/sup> March 2022, the students of CamTech University were given a captivating and essential special lecture by Professor Chhem Kieth Rethy on the topic \u201cA Life in Science\u201d.<\/p><p>Explaining the differences between nature, nurture, and chance has enlightened young people as they realize that humans are all born with unique abilities. As a result, it is vitally important to maintain our self-confidence and positive attitudes to keep moving forward in the face of challenges.<\/p><p>Professor Rethy\u2019s speech about his life journey to becoming a scientist has inspired all the CamTech students to pursue their dreams and do what they believe is right for themselves. &#8220;I have no regrets in my life because I do what I want to do,&#8221; the professor responded to one of the students\u2019 inquiry. These remarks have enabled the students to perceive their own potential.<\/p><p>As long as you hold an unwavering passion or potential for a particular endeavor, nothing is impossible in life.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-0a88976 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"0a88976\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-572735e\" data-id=\"572735e\" data-element_type=\"c